{"text": " Brethren, we have met to worship and adore the Lord our God. Will you pray with all your power while we try to preach the Word? All is made unless the Spirit of the Holy One comes down. Brethren, pray and holy manner will be showered all around you. Brethren, see for sinners around you. Slumbering on the brick of war, that is coming hell is moving. Can you bear to let them go? See our fathers and our mothers, see our children sinking down. Brethren, pray and holy manner will be showered all around you. Brethren, pray and holy manner will be showered all around you. Sisters, will you join and help us? Sisters, will you help the trembling mothers who are struggling hard with sin? Tell them all about our Savior, tell them that He will be found. Sisters, pray and holy manner will be showered all around you. Brethren, pray and holy manner will be showered all around you. Let us love our gods supremely, let us love each other too. Let us love and pray for sinners till our God makes all things new. Then He'll call us home to heaven and His table will sit down. Christ will gird Himself and serve us with sweet manner all around.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 3000, "start": 30.0, "end": 41.0, "text": " Brethren, we have met to worship and adore the Lord our God.", "tokens": [50364, 7090, 40300, 11, 321, 362, 1131, 281, 9965, 293, 32060, 264, 3257, 527, 1265, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2705984380510118, "compression_ratio": 1.2095238095238094, "no_speech_prob": 0.1417057365179062}, {"id": 1, "seek": 3000, "start": 41.0, "end": 52.0, "text": " Will you pray with all your power while we try to preach the Word?", "tokens": [50914, 3099, 291, 3690, 365, 439, 428, 1347, 1339, 321, 853, 281, 21552, 264, 8725, 30, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2705984380510118, "compression_ratio": 1.2095238095238094, "no_speech_prob": 0.1417057365179062}, {"id": 2, "seek": 5200, "start": 52.0, "end": 63.0, "text": " All is made unless the Spirit o